      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>ob</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · 간접의문문 ob
정답은 ②이다. '내가 함께 갈 수 있을지 아직 확실하지 않다'처럼 예/아니오로 답할 내용을 간접의문문으로 만들 때는 ob를 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>wenn</choice_text>
          <commentary>wenn은 조건·반복 시간이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>ob</choice_text>
          <commentary>ob이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>als</choice_text>
          <commentary>als는 과거 일회적 시간이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>als ob</choice_text>
          <commentary>als ob는 '마치 ~처럼'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2017년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
