      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문장</keyword>
        <keyword>독일어</keyword>
        <keyword>옮긴</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Er hätte die Prüfung beinahe nicht bestanden.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 독어 · beinahe + 접속법 2식 과거
정답은 ①이다. '하마터면 ~할 뻔했다'는 beinahe와 접속법 2식 과거(hätte ... bestanden)로 표현한다. 합격하지 못할 뻔했으므로 nicht를 넣는다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Er hätte die Prüfung beinahe nicht bestanden.</choice_text>
          <commentary>올바른 표현이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Er hätte die Prüfung beinahe bestanden.</choice_text>
          <commentary>'하마터면 합격할 뻔했다'는 뜻이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Er habe die Prüfung beinahe nicht bestanden.</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법 1식으로 간접화법이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Er hatte die Prüfung beinahe bestanden.</choice_text>
